  "html": "<p>Oroks are the Dungeon Runners \"orc-look-alikes\". <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Kent_the_Artisan\" title=\"Sir Kent the Artisan\">Sir Kent the Artisan</a> speaks of a rumor they are actually pink colored, and gives a quest to collect the Green Paint they use. The Ice Oroks, a sub-category of this cruel race, are nothing more than conservative nature fundamentalists, the <a href=\"/wiki/Townston_Commander\" title=\"Townston Commander\">Townston Commander</a> tells the players. These traits are used in several quests, where you are advised to collect the protesting pickets of <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Aggressor\" title=\"Ice Orok Aggressor\">Ice Orok Aggressor</a>'s and <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Protector\" title=\"Ice Orok Protector\">Ice Orok Protector</a>'s. \nOroks can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kog's_Gearbox\" title=\"Kog's Gearbox\">Kog's Gearbox</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Outpost\" title=\"Orok Outpost\">Orok Outpost</a> on Level 1 of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>. There also are Oroks in <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>.\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 7 subcategories to this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>O</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Chieftain\" title=\"Category:Orok Chieftain\">Orok Chieftain</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Hunter\" title=\"Category:Orok Hunter\">Orok Hunter</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>O cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Juggernaut\" title=\"Category:Orok Juggernaut\">Orok Juggernaut</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Mystic\" title=\"Category:Orok Mystic\">Orok Mystic</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Scout\" title=\"Category:Orok Scout\">Orok Scout</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>O cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Category:Orok Spawn\">Orok Spawn</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Category:Orok Warrior\">Orok Warrior</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Oroks\"</h2>\n<p>There are 88 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Algor_the_Cold\" title=\"Algor the Cold\">Algor the Cold</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>B</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blayde\" title=\"Blayde\">Blayde</a></span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blayde,_Da_Flayme,_and_Phreeze\" title=\"Blayde, Da Flayme, and Phreeze\">Blayde, Da Flayme, and Phreeze</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Mystic\" title=\"Blood Mystic\">Blood Mystic</a></span></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cave_Shaman\" title=\"Cave Shaman\">Cave Shaman</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cave_Yetti\" title=\"Cave Yetti\">Cave Yetti</a></span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Chuck_D'ease\" title=\"Chuck D'ease\">Chuck D'ease</a></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/DJ_Bumping_and_Thumping\" title=\"DJ Bumping and Thumping\">DJ Bumping and Thumping</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Da_Flayme\" title=\"Da Flayme\">Da Flayme</a></span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dice_N'Cube\" title=\"Dice N'Cube\">Dice N'Cube</a></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Hunter\" title=\"Divine Hunter\">Divine Hunter</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Juggernaut\" title=\"Divine Juggernaut\">Divine Juggernaut</a></span></li><li><span class=\"redirect-in-category\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Mystic\" title=\"Divine Mystic\">Divine Mystic</a></span></li><li><span class=\